  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Open RAN Pilot Project, through Parallel Wireless, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA is funding a pilot project to enable Trk Telekom to establish a laboratory test environment for Open RAN solutions and integrate Parallel Wireless technology into its commercial network. The pilot project would create a test environment for 2G, 3G, 4G, and 5G Open RAN solutions from Parallel Wireless and would enable their installation, as well as installation of 5G Open RAN solutions at five field sites on the Trk Telekom network.</narrative>
  </description>
